extensible programming language. ... Python
is OSI Certified Open Source: OSI Certified.

Python Documentation Index
http://www.python.org/doc/
... New-style classes (aka descrintro). Regular expressions. Database
API. Email Us. docs\@python.org. (c) 2004. Python
Software Foundation. Python Documentation. ...

Download Python Software
http://www.python.org/download/
Download Standard Python Software. Python 2.3.3 is the
current production version of Python. ...
Python is OSI Certified Open Source:

Pythonline
http://www.pythonline.com/

Dive Into Python
http://diveintopython.org/
